Subject: [PATCH] SystemProperties: Ayaneo per-game property hooker

Same behaviour and property names as the stock Ayaneo Pocket DS framework, so the
Ayaneo apps can spoof the device / SoC / Android version per game.

--- a/core/java/android/os/SystemProperties.java
